atchi_Uni_sprite.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/2/23/Tokonatchi_Uni_sprite.png/revision/latest?cb=20240809162044","caption":"Игровой спрайт · Токонатчи","sprite":true},{"file":"https://tamagotchi.fandom.com/wiki/File:Tanetameha.png","remote":"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/tamagotchi/images/a/a5/Tanetameha.png/revision/latest?cb=20151221212842","caption":"Из альбома «Токонатчи» · № 22"}],"related":[{"id":"tamagotchi-uni-52d523","title":"Tamagotchi Uni","ru":"Tamagotchi Uni","kind":"device","note":"гость (NPC)"}]}